### Create Sample Deal

POST http://localhost:8080/api/deals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dealName": "Sample Opportunity",
  "companyName": "Example Account",
  "dealValue": 12000,
  "stage": "PROPOSAL",
  "lifecycleState": "ACTIVE",
  "dealStatus": "ACTIVE",
  "dealType": "COMMERCIAL",
  "owner": "Alex Rep",
  "probability": 65,
  "contractStatus": "OPEN",
  "notes": "Generic sample deal for local API testing."
}

### Get All Deals

GET http://localhost:8080/api/deals

### Get Sample Deal

GET http://localhost:8080/api/deals/1

### Update Sample Deal

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/deals/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dealName": "Sample Opportunity",
  "companyName": "Example Account",
  "dealValue": 15000,
  "stage": "NEGOTIATION",
  "lifecycleState": "ACTIVE",
  "dealStatus": "ACTIVE",
  "dealType": "COMMERCIAL",
  "owner": "Alex Rep",
  "probability": 75,
  "contractStatus": "OPEN",
  "notes": "Updated generic sample deal after follow-up."
}

### Create Activity For Sample Deal

POST http://localhost:8080/api/deals/1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activityType": "CALL",
  "outcome": "CONNECTED",
  "notes": "Reviewed sample opportunity timing and next steps."
}

### Verify Deal Updated

GET http://localhost:8080/api/deals/1

### Get Activities For Sample Deal

GET http://localhost:8080/api/deals/1/activities

### Get Cadence For Sample Deal

GET http://localhost:8080/api/deals/1/cadence

### Get Priority For Sample Deal

GET http://localhost:8080/api/deals/1/priority

### Get Task Queue

GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks

### Delete Sample Deal - run only if you want to remove local test data

DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/deals/1

### Get Action Recommendation For Sample Deal

GET http://localhost:8080/api/deals/1/recommendation

### Make Sample Deal Overdue

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/deals/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dealName": "Sample Opportunity",
  "companyName": "Example Account",
  "dealValue": 12000,
  "stage": "PROPOSAL",
  "lifecycleState": "ACTIVE",
  "dealStatus": "ACTIVE",
  "dealType": "COMMERCIAL",
  "owner": "Alex Rep",
  "probability": 65,
  "lastContactDate": "2026-05-25",
  "nextFollowUpDate": "2026-05-24",
  "contractStatus": "OPEN",
  "notes": "Generic overdue sample for local API testing."
}

### Create Follow-Up Activity

POST http://localhost:8080/api/deals/1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activityType": "CALL",
  "outcome": "CONNECTED",
  "notes": "Testing follow-up update."
}

### Get Forecast Insight For Sample Deal

GET http://localhost:8080/api/forecast/deals/1/insight
